BEGIN_PGML


Find the extrema of [` f(x,y,z) = x+3y+5z `] on [` x^2+y^2+z^2=1 `].

Maximum: [________]{sqrt(35)}.

Minimum: [________]{-sqrt(35)}.
END_PGML

ENDDOCUMENT();